  "guid": "com.acidphantasm.previewsizer",
  "name": "Preview Sizer",
  "slug": "preview-sizer",
  "teaser": "Primarily required if you are using StatTrack or Realism, especially so if you use both. This will allow you to customize the preview icons and window sizes by removing fields.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/Pidu179c2KNZq23FqafCqyoXbHfRQ8XatisK1VZw.png",
  "downloads": 2382,
  "favourites_count": 7,
  "description": "<p>Fix your item preview windows so they show up on the screen properly. Customizable in F12.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RfMoE0G.png\" alt=\"Imgur\" /></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Preview Sizer</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the BepInEx folder in the zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the BepInEx folder from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><hr />\n<ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-previewsizer</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">RECOMMENDED MODS</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1853/stattrack\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">StatTrack</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">SUPPORT</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Please comment on the hub page, or preferably create an issue on the GitHub, or <em>more</em> preferably visit #acidphantasm-mods in the SPT Discord!</p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
